'''Flare''' is a [[Blaze]] type [[Mob]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Magma Chamber}} on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
'''Flares''' spawn on 12 different stone pillars which surround the {{Zone|Magma Chamber}} platform. They all respawn in intervals of around 10 seconds and only one can spawn on each pillar at a time.

== Behavior ==
'''Flares''' are three [[Blaze]] mobs stacked on top of each other with each blaze sharing the same {{Stat|health}} pool of {{HP|5,000,000}} with each other. They act as sentries shooting high damage fireballs. However, they do not take knockback, move, or face the player making them easy targets from a distance. Their range of attack is also considered poor for a sentry-like mob, typically anyone standing around the Magma Chamber (for example while fighting the [[Magma Boss]]) will never be targeted by them. Anyone approaching the area through the stairs may get targeted, though.

If a flare misses its attack, it will not be able to throw another fireball for a while, rendering it vulnerable for follow-up attacks by the player as they have no melee attacks. Caution should be taken when flares are respawning as they attack immediately on sight.

